= Year of the natural sciences course of the University of Cambridge
{parent=Natural sciences course of the University of Cambridge}

The physics course entries below follow the Cavendish Laboratory's 2025–26 teaching list.https://www.phy.cam.ac.uk/study/undergraduate/undergraduate-courses/[Undergraduate Courses: course list and academic-year notice]{ref}

Past examination papers: https://www-teach.phy.cam.ac.uk/dms/dmsSearch.php?type=examPapers[Physics Teaching Information System past-paper search] (University sign-in required). Specific paper years and their solution availability must be checked inside the system.

